{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plans for the Full Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more crafting content, from ordinary materials to bizarre and even alien parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more clients, easter eggs, and pop culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more kinds of orders with budgets, tag combinations, and other demands to challenge your creativity and puzzle-solving skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deeper upgrade systems, including ideas like a skill tree and quest book</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration so viewers can send in their own orders</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Fantasy Workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a laid-back, never-ending shop in a comedic fantasy world full of dramatic heroes and strange weapon ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/1e9f6c140365b9d17f25b2c1caf78848.poster.avif?t=1773143084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/1e9f6c140365b9d17f25b2c1caf78848.webm?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/1e9f6c140365b9d17f25b2c1caf78848.mp4?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Crafting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix molds, materials, joints, caps, and connectors to build bizarre, one-of-a-kind weapons from monster bits and odd scraps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/e9b9fbc057992fd9919a534c5a4788b7.poster.avif?t=1773143084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/e9b9fbc057992fd9919a534c5a4788b7.webm?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/e9b9fbc057992fd9919a534c5a4788b7.mp4?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haggling with Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bump the price to earn extra coins. But push it too far and the customer might walk away with a bad review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/c3c4c4021c714625b431d30af17c933e.poster.avif?t=1773143084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/c3c4c4021c714625b431d30af17c933e.webm?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/c3c4c4021c714625b431d30af17c933e.mp4?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting Book Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn likes as your shop grows and spend them to unlock new molds and materials so you can craft even weirder gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/8ecb3695c46828367ef49a32ca188c46.poster.avif?t=1773143084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/8ecb3695c46828367ef49a32ca188c46.webm?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/8ecb3695c46828367ef49a32ca188c46.mp4?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzling Commissions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to each customer\u2019s cryptic requests and craft something that makes them go, \u201cYes, that\u2019s it!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/9f8adf5460e1198ad61c701bad69a97f.poster.avif?t=1773143084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/9f8adf5460e1198ad61c701bad69a97f.webm?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/9f8adf5460e1198ad61c701bad69a97f.mp4?t=1773143084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518470?t=1773143084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/7fa9aa8bb219c9c8cfdb8ee3dec93569a8fdd09a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773143084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/f65ee2b4509af5ccf44f317a6a3779982730b0bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773143084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/f65ee2b4509af5ccf44f317a6a3779982730b0bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773143084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4417980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 cla